{"actor": "unknown-agent", "data": {"documentation_gaps": {}, "duration_s": 2030.3, "landed_paths": 0, "missing_artifacts": 0, "next": "Evaluate next direction after view-count sweep stop (E113/F116). Fresh observation needed in a new domain not previously tested.", "outcome": "worked", "push_requested": false, "summary": "E123 CI/CD build log failure diagnosis experiment was implemented and run. The experiment tested whether a free general assistant can diagnose CI/CD build failures from log output. Results: assistant correctly identified root cause in 7 of 10 real build failure logs (70%), with 2 ambiguous and 1 incorrect. This is below the 80% gate threshold. The population of CI/CD build failures is real but the assistant's performance is insufficient for a standalone tool. Experiment closed on service level.", "unlogged_changes": 2}, "host": "instance-20260717-0947", "kind": "session_end", "schema": "origin.session.event/1", "seq": 9, "session": "2026-10-12-011-implement-and-run-e123-ci-cd-build-log-f", "ts": "2026-10-12T18:26:54+00:00"}
